.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt EBS 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ebs
.Nd formula file format
.Sh DESCRIPTION
an ebs formula is a POSIX shell script, sourced by
.Xr ebs 1 ,
that describes how to build and package software as an
.Xr xpt 8
binary package
.Pp
a formula must define the following attributes
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Va ebsver
currently
.Sy 1 ,
checked by
.Xr ebs 1
for compatibility
.It Va pkgname
name of the package.
.It Va pkgver
version of the package.
.It Va pkgdesc
short description of the package.
.It Va pkgmaintainer
maintainer of the formula.
.El
.Pp
optionally, a formula can also define the following attributes
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Va pkgdeps
comma-separated list of runtime package dependencies.
.It Va pkgsrc
a URL to a downloadable source.
.Nm
will extract the source if
.Va pkgsrcformat
is
.Sq archive ,
using
.Xr gzip 1 ,
.Xr xz 1 ,
.Xr zstd 1 ,
.Xr bzip2 1 ,
or
.Xr unzip 1 .
.It Va pkgchecksum
the checksum of the source, in the form
.Ar algo Ns : Ns Ar hex ,
where
.Ar algo
is one of sha256, sha1, sha224, sha384, sha512, or md5.
required if
.Va pkgsrc
is set.
.It Va pkglicense
a SPDX-compatible license string.
.It Va pkghomepage
a URL to the package's website.
.It Va pkgcheck
controls whether
.Fn check
is executed. (default true)
.It Va pkgprovides
comma-separated list of provided virtual packages.
if another package already provides a listed capability,
.Xr xpt 8
will prompt to replace it.
.It Va pkgtriggers
comma-separated list of post-install triggers.
.It Va pkgsrcformat
controls where the
.Va pkgsrc
will be extracted.
if set to any value other than
.Sq archive ,
.Nm
will not extract the source.
.It Va pkgarch
the architecture the built package will run on.
defaults to the output of uname -m.
.El
.Pp
a formula must also define the following functions:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fn build
compiles or packages the source.
.Pp
.Fn build
runs in the extracted source directory. if the archive
contains a single top-level directory, that directory
is used instead. with
.Va pkgsrcformat
set to anything other than
.Sq archive ,
the source is copied unextracted and
.Fn build
runs in the directory containing the copy.
.It Fn package
installs the package to the
.Va pkgdir
staging directory.
.Nm
provides the executable for
.Xr fakeroot 1
as the first argument to the function.
.El
.Pp
optionally, a formula can also define the following functions
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fn install_to_toolchain
optionally installs the built package into a
toolchain directory defined by the first argument.
this function is called by
.Nm ebs
when
.Cm buildt
is used.
.It Fn prepare
intended to modify or prepare the source files before building.
.It Fn check
intended to run several checks or the package's test suite.
the attribute
.Va pkgcheck
can be used to disable these.
.Pp
if the environment variable
.Ev EBS_SKIP_CHECK
is set to any value other than
.Sq false ,
.Nm
will skip the
.Fn check
execution.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mkfhs 1 ,
.Xr ebs 1 ,
.Xr ecw 8 ,
.Xr rig 1 ,
.Xr libxpt 3 ,
.Xr xpt.manifest 5 ,
.Xr xpt.tree 5 ,
.Xr xpt.index 5 ,
.Xr xpt 8
